  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 47d71981a39ce93409e921c2aa3b200e, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - Oh, you're back! You didn't want to go back to the humans, did you?
  - THOSE HUMANS DID WHAT?! KILL ALL YOUR FRIENDS?!
  - 'I think you do perfectly fine here in the forest! '
  - Aren't you related to those Boars anyways? Did you got the chance meet them already?
  - Well they are not thaaat friendly with strangers but since you are both pigs
    maybe they can relate to you or something?
  - I reckon you can follow those footprints up to the north. I'm pretty sure they
    belong to them!
